OL,3,GNEWSAHeaps of loft insulation
OL,4,Afly-tipped on road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large quantity of loft insulation and
OL,7,Fother material was found by a litter
OL,8,Fpicker after being fly-tipped on a
OL,9,Fsmall lane.
OL,11,FIt was found on Sunday in Upton Road,
OL,12,Fclose to the A47 in Peterborough.
OL,14,FMark Fishpool, who set up the Pride in
OL,15,Four Community volunteers group, said
OL,16,Fstrong winds appeared to have blown the
OL,17,Fmaterial all over the road.
OL,19,FIt was reported and a spokesperson for
OL,20,Fthe city council said staff cleared the
OL,21,Fwaste on Monday morning.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
